      "text": "Group chat: all four others confirmed alive. Jake's only contribution was \"hey im her alie im alive!\" — no answer on the phone. I gave him a multiple-choice (1 = explain phone, 2 = not explaining yet, 3 = doesn't remember) and told Kyrie to actually inspect the phone's last open app/screen time instead of just holding it. Sammy floated \"he's possessed\" and I told him to keep a priest on retainer, not speed dial.",
