      ],
      "text": "Zoe just pulled off the most impressive legal maneuver I've ever seen — invoking a constitutional amendment to get Jake off the hook for one question. I'm half furious she thought of it before I did, half impressed because it worked. Jake asked about Evil Dead II, which means his brain is still online, and that's the first genuinely normal thing he's done since he went quiet. But he still owes me a digit. One character. I've built cases on less, and I'm not dropping this because Zoe found a loophole.",
